  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Video Text\n\nBig bold letters used as a window onto moving imagery: here a drifting ocean-coloured gradient with soft moving light, visible only inside the letters.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A big one-word title should carry moving colour or footage inside its letters.\n- A title card needs a texture that hints at the topic (water, fire, city lights).\n\nAvoid when:\n- The text is small or long: the footage inside will not read.\n- A static colour fill is enough.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"OCEAN\"\n- font_size (number, 40-800): Font size, default 420\n- color_a (color): Colour A, default \"#0b3b8c\"\n- color_b (color): Colour B, default \"#0e8fa8\"\n- color_c (color): Colour C, default \"#a5f3fc\"\n- speed (number, 0.2-4): Drift speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Video Text\n\n  Big bold letters used as a window onto moving imagery: here a drifting ocean-coloured gradient with soft moving light, visible only inside the letters.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui/blob/166367b4e31a27f166fd6c2b71d7be290fe0c1bc/apps/www/registry/magicui/video-text.tsx\n  Changes by usemosio/blocks: the source masks a video clip with the text; this block has no video, so the letters show a drifting gradient with moving light patches instead.\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Magic UI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"video-text\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"The word the footage shows through. Short, in capitals reads best.\", \"default\": \"OCEAN\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 420, \"min\": 40, \"max\": 800, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color_a\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Colour A\", \"description\": \"Deep colour of the default fill.\", \"default\": \"#0b3b8c\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color_b\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Colour B\", \"description\": \"Mid colour of the default fill.\", \"default\": \"#0e8fa8\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color_c\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Colour C\", \"description\": \"Highlight colour of the default fill.\", \"default\": \"#a5f3fc\"},\n    {\"id\": \"speed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Drift speed\", \"description\": \"How fast the default fill drifts.\", \"default\": 1, \"min\": 0.2, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.1}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Video Text</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@800;900&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .vtx-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\n        .vtx-svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }\n        .vtx-text { font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"video-text\" data-duration=\"5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"vtx-clip\" class=\"vtx-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <svg id=\"vtx-svg\" class=\"vtx-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\">\n            <defs>\n              <linearGradient id=\"vtx-grad\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" spreadMethod=\"repeat\"></linearGradient>\n              <mask id=\"vtx-mask\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><text id=\"vtx-text\" class=\"vtx-text\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\"></text></mask>\n            </defs>\n            <g id=\"vtx-fill\" mask=\"url(#vtx-mask)\">\n              <rect id=\"vtx-base\" fill=\"url(#vtx-grad)\"></rect>\n              <ellipse id=\"vtx-glow-1\"></ellipse><ellipse id=\"vtx-glow-2\"></ellipse><ellipse id=\"vtx-glow-3\"></ellipse>\n            </g>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, options, fallback) {\n              return options.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font until it fits a share of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, share) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var max = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * share);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > max) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (max / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            // A seeded random generator, so every seek draws the same thing.\n            function mulberry32(a) {\n              return function () {\n                a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n                var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n                t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n                return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n              };\n            }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var TAG = \"vtx\";\n            var bezN = 0;\n            function bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return CustomEase.create(TAG + \"-\" + bezN++, \"M0,0 C\" + x1 + \",\" + y1 + \" \" + x2 + \",\" + y2 + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function finish() {\n              var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"video-text\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n            var svg = document.getElementById(\"vtx-svg\");\n            var W = root.clientWidth, H = root.clientHeight;\n            svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 \" + W + \" \" + H);\n            var text = str(vars.text, \"OCEAN\");\n            var textEl = document.getElementById(\"vtx-text\");\n            svg.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", text);\n            textEl.textContent = text;\n            textEl.setAttribute(\"x\", W / 2);\n            textEl.setAttribute(\"y\", H / 2);\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 420, 40, 800);\n            textEl.setAttribute(\"font-size\", size);\n            // Shrink to 90 % of the frame width when wider.\n            var wide = textEl.getComputedTextLength();\n            if (wide > W * 0.9) { size = Math.max(24, size * (W * 0.9) / wide); textEl.setAttribute(\"font-size\", size); }\n            var maskEl = document.getElementById(\"vtx-mask\");\n            maskEl.setAttribute(\"x\", 0); maskEl.setAttribute(\"y\", 0); maskEl.setAttribute(\"width\", W); maskEl.setAttribute(\"height\", H);\n            var ca = col(vars.color_a, \"#0b3b8c\"), cb = col(vars.color_b, \"#0e8fa8\"), cc = col(vars.color_c, \"#a5f3fc\");\n            var grad = document.getElementById(\"vtx-grad\");\n            var span = Math.max(W, H);\n            [[0, ca], [0.45, cb], [0.75, cc], [1, ca]].forEach(function (s) {\n              var st = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"stop\");\n              st.setAttribute(\"offset\", s[0]); st.setAttribute(\"stop-color\", s[1]);\n              grad.appendChild(st);\n            });\n            grad.setAttribute(\"x1\", 0); grad.setAttribute(\"y1\", 0); grad.setAttribute(\"x2\", span); grad.setAttribute(\"y2\", span * 0.35);\n            var base = document.getElementById(\"vtx-base\");\n            base.setAttribute(\"x\", 0); base.setAttribute(\"y\", 0); base.setAttribute(\"width\", W); base.setAttribute(\"height\", H);\n            // Soft drifting light patches, on seeded orbits, so the fill moves like footage.\n            var rnd = mulberry32(11);\n            var defs = svg.querySelector(\"defs\");\n            var glows = [1, 2, 3].map(function (i) {\n              var id = \"vtx-rg-\" + i;\n              var rg = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"radialGradient\");\n              rg.id = id;\n              var s1 = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"stop\");\n              s1.setAttribute(\"offset\", 0); s1.setAttribute(\"stop-color\", i === 2 ? ca : cc); s1.setAttribute(\"stop-opacity\", 0.85);\n              var s2 = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"stop\");\n              s2.setAttribute(\"offset\", 1); s2.setAttribute(\"stop-color\", i === 2 ? ca : cc); s2.setAttribute(\"stop-opacity\", 0);\n              rg.appendChild(s1); rg.appendChild(s2); defs.appendChild(rg);\n              var el = document.getElementById(\"vtx-glow-\" + i);\n              el.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"url(#\" + id + \")\");\n              return { el: el, cx: W * (0.2 + rnd() * 0.6), cy: H * (0.4 + rnd() * 0.2), ax: W * (0.15 + rnd() * 0.15), ay: H * 0.04, ph: rnd() * 6.283, sp: 0.6 + rnd() * 0.8, r: Math.max(W, H) * (0.22 + rnd() * 0.12) };\n            });\n            var speed = num(vars.speed, 1, 0.2, 4);\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function draw(t) {\n              var s = t * speed;\n              grad.setAttribute(\"gradientTransform\", \"translate(\" + (-s * span * 0.25).toFixed(2) + \" \" + (s * span * 0.04).toFixed(2) + \")\");\n              glows.forEach(function (g) {\n                g.el.setAttribute(\"cx\", (g.cx + Math.sin(s * g.sp + g.ph) * g.ax).toFixed(2));\n                g.el.setAttribute(\"cy\", (g.cy + Math.cos(s * g.sp * 0.8 + g.ph) * g.ay).toFixed(2));\n                g.el.setAttribute(\"rx\", g.r); g.el.setAttribute(\"ry\", g.r * 0.5);\n              });\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            finish();\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "d5216a66bf085798ed8deb84142ea1178675290042454e459ccaa853c3bc3f78",
